{"ocrText": "He cocked his head. \"What do you mean?\" he said.\n\"She lives here now. Jane died. She married some jerk who\nput her on the back of his motorcycle and drove\nit off a cliff.\"\n\"A car must have forced them off the road,\" he\nsaid. His\nvoice was very quiet. \"Oh my God,\" he\nsaid. \"Jane's dead?\"\n\"I was in L.A. for the funeral when you were calling me.\"\n\"She was on a motorcycle?\" Les said.\nLucy nodded. Les was doing what she sometimes did her-\nself. The incredulity was real, but the theory was silly: that\nif\nyou could just repeat facts, stall for time, you might not have to\nhear the same ending to the story.\n235", "textLayer": [{"text": "He", "x": 10.43, "y": 5.56, "w": 3.65, "h": 2.31, "fontSize": 11.5}, {"text": "cocked", "x": 15.17, "y": 5.98, "w": 8.29, "h": 1.75, "fontSize": 8.7}, {"text": "his", "x": 24.64, "y": 6.24, "w": 3.32, "h": 1.4, "fontSize": 7.0}, {"text": "head.", "x": 29.19, "y": 6.1, "w": 6.26, "h": 1.58, "fontSize": 7.9}, {"text": "\"What", "x": 36.78, "y": 5.79, "w": 7.92, "h": 2.0, "fontSize": 10.0}, {"text": "do", "x": 45.97, "y": 5.92, "w": 2.89, "h": 1.83, "fontSize": 9.1}, {"text": "you", "x": 49.95, "y": 5.87, "w": 4.5, "h": 1.9, "fontSize": 9.5}, {"text": "mean?\"", "x": 55.69, "y": 5.84, "w": 9.15, "h": 1.93, "fontSize": 9.6}, {"text": "he", "x": 66.02, "y": 6.01, "w": 2.75, "h": 1.74, "fontSize": 8.7}, {"text": "said.", "x": 69.9, "y": 6.31, "w": 5.31, "h": 1.34, "fontSize": 6.7}, {"text": "\"She", "x": 10.38, "y": 8.06, "w": 5.97, "h": 1.89, "fontSize": 9.4}, {"text": "lives", "x": 17.58, "y": 8.48, "w": 5.26, "h": 1.33, "fontSize": 6.6}, {"text": "here", "x": 24.08, "y": 8.28, "w": 5.17, "h": 1.63, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "now.", "x": 30.43, "y": 8.12, "w": 5.73, "h": 1.81, "fontSize": 9.1}, {"text": "Jane", "x": 37.16, "y": 8.3, "w": 5.45, "h": 1.72, "fontSize": 8.6}, {"text": "died.", "x": 43.74, "y": 8.37, "w": 5.83, "h": 1.47, "fontSize": 7.4}, {"text": "She", "x": 50.95, "y": 8.08, "w": 4.41, "h"